From c8e91b34741294fde59ae6ca20ccde4eb6422553 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bluebird <linlanxi7552659@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 04:30:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] DevTools: add Extensions.setUserScriptsAccess

Add a browser-target-only CDP command for changing the current profile's per-extension userScripts access preference. Reuse the existing unsafe extension operation gate, which requires the pipe client capability and --enable-unsafe-extension-debugging, then restrict the extension to enabled unpacked installations that declare userScripts.

Base-Revision: 7c855c70efe3f6ade6663c1520913fa7f63a0b2b
